#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:4
msgid "Installing OpenToonz"
msgstr "安装OpenToonz"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:10
msgid "Downloading OpenToonz"
msgstr "下载OpenToonz"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:11
msgid ""
"You can download the appropriate version of OpenToonz for your operating "
"system from the `Download page <https://opentoonz.github.io/e/download/"
"opentoonz.html>`_ in the official OpenToonz web site. Choose either the "
"Windows or macOS version to start downloading the installer application."
msgstr ""
"您可以从以下网址下载适用于您的操作系统的OpenToonz的相应版本<https://"
"opentoonz.github.io/e/download/opentoonz.html>`_ 在OpenToonz官网。选择Windows"
"或macOS版本开始现在安装程序。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:13
msgid ""
"At the bottom of that same page it's also possible to find the developer's "
"\"Nightly Builds\" (new versions of the software compiled each night for "
"testing purposes), with which you will be able to try out the latest "
"features and bug fixes, as they are being included in OpenToonz."
msgstr ""
"在同一页面的底部，还可以找到开发人员的“Nightly Builds”（每天晚上为测试目的编"
"译的软件的新版本），您将能够通过它尝试最新的功能和错误修复，因为它们包含在"
"OpenToonz中。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:15
msgid ""
"WARNING: Use at you own risk! A Nightly Build version could potentially be "
"an unstable one, so it is not adviced nor supported, for use in production "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"警告：使用风险自负！Nightly Build版本可能不稳定，因此不建议也不支持在生产环境"
"中使用。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:17
msgid ""
"All other builds apart from the ones downloaded from the official web site "
"ARE NOT officially supported by OpenToonz."
msgstr "除从官方网站下载的版本外，OpenToonz不支持所有其他版本。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Morevna Project <https://github.com/morevnaproject>`_ provides builds for "
"`Windows 32-bit, Windows 64-bit, macOS, and appimage <https://github.com/"
"morevnaproject/opentoonz/releases>`_ as well as `snap <https://snapcraft.io/"
"opentoonz-morevna>`_ for Linux."
msgstr ""
"`Morevna项目<https://github.com/morevnaproject>`_提供Windows 32位、Windows 64"
"位、macOS和appimage的版本<https://github.com/morevnaproject/opentoonz/"
"releases>`_以及“snap”<https://snapcraft.io/opentoonz-morevna>`_对于Linux。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:21
msgid ""
"Finally, there's also an OpenToonz fork called `Tahoma2D <https://tahoma2d."
"org>`_ avalaible for Windows, macOS and Linux, that could represent a good "
"alternative for certain use cases, where it could be possible to find "
"slightly different approaches to some of the core features in the software, "
"as well as its own new solutions and tools."
msgstr ""
"最后，还有一个名为Tahoma2D的OpenToonz分叉<https://tahoma2d.org>`_适用于"
"Windows、macOS和Linux，这可能是某些用例的一个很好的替代方案，在这些用例中，可"
"以找到稍微不同的方法来实现软件中的一些核心功能，以及它自己的新解决方案和工"
"具。"

#: ../../source/installing_opentoonz.rst:23
msgid ""
"All in all, the OpenToonz ecosystem is an open, diverse and fluid one, which "
"means that most novel features, improvements and fixes developed for one of "
"its variants, would most probably end up appearing in the other ones too, "
"within time."
msgstr ""
"总而言之，OpenToonz生态系统是一个开放、多样化和流动的生态系统，这意味着为其变"
"体之一开发的大多数新功能、改进和修复很可能最终也会在一段时间内出现在其他变体"
"中。"

